message: >-
  If these protocols or their implementations helped your work,
  please mention this work.
type: software
title: bossloop
version: v0.6.3
date-released: "2026-11-08"
authors:
  - alias: Ziqing7226
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ziqing7226/bossloop"
abstract: >-
  A collection of portable-by-design protocols (with reference
  implementations) for bounded loops run by autonomous AI teams:
  idea validation through build-test-write-review cycles, and robust
  engineering development through plan-build-cold-test-amend-push
  rounds — each loop hard-stops on schedule and reports honestly
  to the boss. Roles run on tiered models — strong for planning and
  review, cheap for build and test — so larger jobs cost less.
